--- !u!114 &194862514
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 194862506}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a52feb26d162e7b4583f76fe78ad94df, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1379340421}
  texts:
  - good morning, captain. as you know, our world became a depressing place. people
    stopped caring about art. they threw their joy into space. your mission is to
    bring the joy back. we count on you.
  - good start, captain. there's more music to collect. we will remind people the
    power of music. let's get to work.
  - good job, captain. be careful out there. obstacles will be many. but I believe
    they can not stop you.
  - captain, I... there's a problem. I'll be right back. go on with your mission.
    good luck.
  - captain... I'm afraid things are not well. people listen to the music but they
    feel nothing. all we can do is hoping they'll undertand, at some point. let's
    keep going.
  - captain... it's not working. we have to rethink our plan.
  - captain... give up. come home. there's no hope.
  - captain. I command you to come back home. this is meaningless. we need you back
    home.
  - captain. this is an order. come back home. you are only serving your ego right
    now.
  - captain... look... we should have never sent you there. just come back. do you
    want to die?
  - captain, your time is running out. your resources will soon be scarce. you have
    to come back home.
  - you don't listen to my orders. you are dead to me. bye.
  - ...
  - ...
  - ... *static* ...
  - ...
  - ...
  - ... *static* ... *music playing* ...
  - ... captain... are you alive... *static*
  - ... *static* ... *static* ... *static* ...
  - ... captain... *static* you're not hearing this, are you? *static*
  - ... captain... *static* ... music... *static* ... they are listening to the music...
    *static*
  - ... *static* ...
  - captain, I'm *static* sure you're not getting my *static* but... thank you.
  - ... *static* captain, you did it! *static* it's magical *static*
  - '*static* captain... thank you for everything. *static*'
  noOfPlanes: 030000000400000005000000040000000300000004000000050000000600000007000000060000000500000004000000030000000400000003000000040000000300000002000000020000000100000002000000030000000400000005000000060000000700000008000000
  state: 0
